[26.226935, "o", "\u001b[27m, not a claim \u001b[7mof\u001b[27m WCAG 1.4.11   \u001b[49m \u001b[49m\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\u001b[48;2;1;2;54m \u001b[48;2;1;2;54m \u001b[38;2;1;2;48m\u001b[7mconformance for essential graphical distinctions\u001b[27m. \u001b[7mThey make colored code turquoise again\u001b[27m, \u001b[7mbut do \u001b[49m \u001b[49m\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\u001b[48;2;1;2;54m \u001b[48;2;1;2;54m \u001b[7;38;2;1;2;48m\u001b[27m **\u001b[7mnot\u001b[27m** \u001b[7mfix the shared `dim` token: it appears both in the footer on D and inside tool panels   \u001b[49m \u001b[49m\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\u001b[48;2;1;2;54m \u001b[48;2;1;2;54m \u001b[7;38;2;1;2;48mon T\u001b[27m. Requiring \u001b[7m4.5 for both positions drives the footer's\u001b[27m `\u001b[7mdim\u001b[27m` \u001b[7mtext \u001b[27mto \u001b[7mabout 9\u001b[27m:1 \u001b[7magainst D\u001b[27m,    \u001b[49m \u001b[49m\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\u001b[48;2;1;2;54m \u001b[48;2;1;2;54m \u001b[38;2;1;2;48m\u001b[7mbrighter than the 7:\u001b[27m1\u001b[7m main text\u001b[27m.\u001b[7m A context-specific Pi token\u001b[27m, \u001b[7mdifferent panel relationship, or   \u001b[49m \u001b[49m\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\u001b[48;2;1;2;54m \u001b[48;2;1;2;54m \u001b[7;38;2;1;2;48maltered text requirement is necessary to change that. Color\u001b[27m-only tool status may \u001b[7malso\u001b[27m fail WCAG  \u001b[49m \u001b[49m\u001b["]
